  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://gavv-gozyuger-25movie.com/",
          "overview": "TegaSword dies?! The disaster that triggered the outbreak of the Universe War in the past. TegaSword was defeated by a Calamity remnant named Pestis. All it needs to revive is the ring that is the core of the stolen TegaSword. To retrieve the ring, the Gozyugers jump into the body of TegaSword, where Pestis is hiding and face many challenges!  Will the five \"outcasts\" be able to unite and overcome the challenges? The shocking truth behind the birth of TegaSword is revealed for the first time?! Fight, Gozyuger! Revive the giant TegaSword! Protect the dreams and wishes of people!!",
          "runtime": 30,
          "tagline": "All of humanity becomes Sentai.",
          "title": "No. 1 Sentai Gozyuger: TegaSword of Resurrection"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "过去那场宇宙大战爆发的契机，灾厄的残党——“佩斯提斯”，在其猛攻之下手誓剑被打倒了！复活手誓剑所需要的是被夺走的作为手誓剑核心的戒指。五兽者们为了夺回戒指，飞身闯入了佩斯提斯所潜伏的手誓剑体内，向重重考验发起挑战！这五位“离群者”能否团结一致克服试炼？以及，首次被揭露的隐藏在手誓剑诞生背后的冲击性真相究竟是什么!?",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "头号战队豪兽者 复活的特伽索德"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "JP",
        "iso_639_1": "ja",
        "name": "日本語",
        "english_name": "Japanese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "かつてのユニバース大戦が勃発するきっかけとなった「厄災」の残党であるペスティスによって、巨神テガソードが倒されてしまう。テガソードを復活させるためには、奪われたテガソードの核となる指輪が必要だった。指輪を奪い返すため、日頃は競い合うことも多いはぐれ者集団のゴジュウジャーは一致団結し、ペスティスが潜むテガソードの体内へと飛び込んでいく。ゴジュウジャーが幾多の試練に挑む中で、テガソード誕生の隠された真実が明らかになる。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "O filme de verão começa como sempre, Hoeru em mais um de seus milhares empregos de meio-período e seus companheiros/rivais de time vieram observá-lo trabalhar. Nesse meio tempo, uma nova ameaça chega ao planeta e eles descobrem que TegaSword foi derrotado. Será que os Gozyuger conseguirão salvá-lo?",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
